-\\infty }^{-1}6{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n\n{{field-1}}" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-1}6{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186320744 :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-3}\\frac{5}{2}{e}^{3x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n\n{{field-1}}" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-3}\\frac{5}{2}{e}^{3x}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186320745 :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{-1}^{\\infty }10{e}^{-4x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n\n{{field-1}}" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{-1}^{\\infty }10{e}^{-4x}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186320746 :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{2}{e}^{-5x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n\n{{field-1}}" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{3}{2}{e}^{-5x}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186320747 :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-3x+2}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n\n{{field-1}}" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-3x+2}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186320748 :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }{e}^{-4x-3}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n\n{{field-1}}" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }{e}^{-4x-3}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186320749 :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)}{{sin}^{2}⁡(x)+3}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)}{{sin}^{2}⁡(x)+3}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186320750 :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{24\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x){cos}^{2}⁡(x)}{8{cos}^{3}⁡(x)+5}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{24\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x){cos}^{2}⁡(x)}{8{cos}^{3}⁡(x)+5}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186320751 :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x)}{2+\\operatorname{csc}⁡(x)}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x)}{2+\\operatorname{csc}⁡(x)}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186320752 :question/problem "Express $\\frac{3x+5}{(x-3)(2x+1)}$ as a sum of partial fractions.\n\n|  | $\\frac{3x+5}{(x-3)(2x+1)}\\,=\\,\\frac{2}{x-3}\\,\\,+$ | {{field-1}} |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $2x+1$ |" "Express $\\frac{3x+5}{(x-3)(2x+1)}$ as a sum of partial fractions.\n\n|  | $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{3x+5}{(x-3)(2x+1)}\\,=\\,\\frac{2}{x-3}\\,\\,+\n$$ | {{field-1}} |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | $2x+1$ |"] [:db/cas 17592186320760 :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{3}}4{x}^{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{3}}4{x}^{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 